{"id": "official:sentence:971a1ffa-8a55-4690-929f-d17353e7bece", "text": "我的爱好是游览古老的庙宇。", "shortMeaning": "我喜好逛古老庙宇。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd51e78c-4703-40e9-9028-31a6b446dc12", "text": "我的父亲65岁的时候退休了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸六十五岁那年退了休。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd112ff6-99c1-4739-8e35-f98c75c14efc", "text": "我的父亲于1941年出生在松山。", "shortMeaning": "我爸一九四一年生在松山。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1029ba8-37ee-49c4-87dc-58458a571dd7", "text": "我的父亲很快就会康复。", "shortMeaning": "我爸很快就会好起来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e299ae84-b2f3-4c3b-9123-078727dead49", "text": "我的父亲总是干涉我的私生活。", "shortMeaning": "我爸老插手我的私事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a33f5e18-1e2d-4246-b213-c22bd19ce567", "text": "我的父亲是个好人。", "shortMeaning": "我父亲心眼好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43ba949b-dd06-4406-8caa-8c72a5f822f7", "text": "我的父亲至今还没有出过国。", "shortMeaning": "我爸到如今还没出国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fa7574f-93d6-4753-aa4b-65f22e47cb23", "text": "我的父亲鼓励我去学钢琴。", "shortMeaning": "我爸鼓励我学琴。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e23d1eb0-d7dd-4e67-8d0e-30779c03a605", "text": "我的父母不会让我一个人去的。", "shortMeaning": "爸妈不会让我一个人去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:568e5c60-301a-4f4e-be4a-63af25c2e93b", "text": "我的父母去年去世了。", "shortMeaning": "我爸妈去年都走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:eeed5d35-978d-4346-a869-b054b8c4db30", "text": "我的父母教育我应该尊敬老人。", "shortMeaning": "爸妈教我敬着老人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
